OL,3,GNEWSA'All-night hangout' fears over
OL,4,Aearly hours KFC bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllowing a chicken takeaway to open
OL,7,Fdeep into the early hours risks turning
OL,8,Fthe outskirts of a city councillor into
OL,9,Fan "all-night hangout" spot, a
OL,10,Fcouncillor has claimed.
OL,12,FFast-food chain KFC wants its sit-in
OL,13,Fand drive-thru at Pennywell Industrial
OL,14,FEstate, Sunderland, to stay open until
OL,15,F05:00 every day to cater to shift
OL,16,Fworkers and late-night customers.
OL,18,FThe chain argued the Chester Road
OL,19,Foutlet, which currently shuts at 23:00,
OL,20,Fwould be "suited to later opening,
OL,21,Fbeing situated away from residential
OL,22,Fdwellings".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
