OL,3,GNEWSA'All-night hangout' fears over
OL,4,Aearly hours KFC bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Lib Dem councillor Stephen O'Brien
OL,7,Fsaid residents across the road already
OL,8,Fendured littering and noise and the
OL,9,Fplans would bring "more disturbance and
OL,10,Fantisocial behaviour".
